sourceDesc.p:
Address: To/ The Reverend Herbert Hill/ Streatham Stamped: T P/ Bge St Westmr Postmarks: 2 o’Clock/ 11 MY/ 1822 A Sn; [partial] o’Clock/ 11/ EV Seal: red wax;
                  design illegible MS: Keswick Museum and Art Gallery, WC 217. ALS; 4p. Previously published: John Wood Warter (ed.),
                     Selections from the Letters of Robert Southey, 4 vols (London, 1856), III, pp. 307–309 [in part].
